  "description": "The main character, Hayan, is a sophomore in the Department of Archeology. When she was young, she pursued her dream and enrolled in the Department of Archeology, but she is still contemplating whether she should transfer because of realistic problems such as the contents of her major that are different from her imagination and employment. In the meantime, Hayan is unexpectedly selected as a research scholarship student to investigate historical artifacts that could overturn Korea's ancient history, and decides to rekindle her passion for archeology...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=771988), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=3698734)",
